      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Related: *https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/world-image-on-b3-7a-portal-too-zoomed-in*\n\nCan confirm the VRChat SDK itself uploads thumbnails as 800x600 PNGs, both for worlds and avatars:\n\n```\n\n# PNG Image\n\nFormat: Portable network graphics\n\nSize: 800 x 600 px\n\n```\n\nThis 800x600 image is cropped unpredictably and displayed with different aspect ratios on the website, in portals, and for avatar/world details, making it hard to design a \"safe zone\" where text or key details won't be cut off.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
