      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Also of note is that thumbnails uploaded via the website are forcibly cropped square, which stretches or zooms them in weird ways all across the UI. \n\nThe most annoying one by far though is the fact that the main menu thumbnails are cropped to center despite the text that’s actually causing the crop being at the bottom. This wastes the entire top of the image and could be so easily fixed by just aligning the image to top instead of center. \n\nAlong with the new massive platform icons that take up so much space, the safe zone is ever-shrinking.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
